'        p_embed_model VARCHAR2 DEFAULT ''cohere.embed-multilingual-v3.0'',',
'        p_system_prompt VARCHAR2 DEFAULT ''You are an expert in reviewing audio text on cloud, software, and hardware technology topics. You will provide a json response with a summary element and a comma separated list of the top 25 technology terms '
||'used in the tags element. If no technology terms are used provide an empty tags element. Provide the response on a single line without any explanation.'',',
'        p_max_tokens NUMBER DEFAULT 600,',
